            <p><strong>3D Graphics Library:</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li>Three.js Documentation - <a href="https://threejs.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">threejs.org</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
            <li><strong>Orbital Mechanics:</strong> Planets move using circular orbital math: <code>x = cos(angle) * distance</code></li>
            <li><strong>Materials:</strong> Uses gradient materials for realistic planet surfaces and atmospheric effects</li>
            <li><strong>Lighting:</strong> Multiple light sources (ambient, directional, point) create depth and realism</li>
            <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Optimized with efficient geometry and material reuse</li>
